---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base current="about" title="Our story | The Common Squamish" description="How Peter Buchholz opened The Common on Cleveland Avenue and built a place for Squamish people to work and meet.">
  <header class="page-hd"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow on-dark">Our story</span><h1>Work together.<br />Grow together.</h1><p>Peter opened The Common so people in Squamish could get out of the home office, do good work, and meet one another.</p></div></header>

  <section class="founder-section"><div class="wrap founder-grid">
    <div class="founder-copy"><span class="kicker">Since 2017</span><h2>Why Peter opened The Common.</h2><p>Peter Buchholz opened The Common in an original 1970s building on Cleveland Avenue. He knew the pull of working remotely, and the part it could leave out: a conversation over lunch, someone to ask for a second opinion, a reason to leave the house.</p><p>He made room for both sides of the day. There are desks where you can focus, and a kitchen, communal tables, and a courtyard where you can get to know the people sharing the space.</p><p>In his first update to members, Peter admitted that building the room was only the beginning. He wanted to spend more time bringing the people in it together. That thought still guides The Common.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/stories/first-weeks/">The first weeks at The Common</a></div>
    <div class="founder-photos"><img class="peter-photo" src="/img/story/peter-buchholz.jpg" alt="Peter Buchholz, founder of The Common" loading="lazy" /><img class="entrance-photo" src="/img/common/photo-15.jpg" alt="The entrance to The Common on Cleveland Avenue" loading="lazy" /><img class="town-photo" src="/img/story/chief-from-courtyard.jpg" alt="View toward the Stawamus Chief from The Common's courtyard" loading="lazy" /></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="workday-section" aria-labelledby="workday-title"><div class="workday-collage" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/story/working-front.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /><img src="/img/story/working-main.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /><img src="/img/story/working-window.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="wrap workday-content"><span class="kicker">A day here</span><h2 id="workday-title">Come in, get settled, get something done.</h2><p>Take a desk by the front windows or tuck into the main room. Make your lunch in the kitchen. Step outside for a break, then come back to the thing you were working on.</p><p>Some people come in for an hour. Some are here most days. Either way, you don't have to work alone.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/day-pass/">Try a day here</a></div></section>

  <section class="name-section"><div class="wrap name-grid"><div class="name-photo"><img src="/img/common/photo-12.jpg" alt="The Common's original wooden sign" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="name-copy"><span class="kicker">Work together. Grow together.</span><h2>A place to work, and people to work alongside.</h2><p>Peter's original site put the people first. Coders, lawyers, students, engineers, green tech founders, local business owners, and people working remotely all found their way here.</p><p>The work is different. The lunch table, the garden, and the conversations between meetings are shared. That's what keeps The Common feeling like Squamish.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/community/">How The Common began</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="section light early-stories"><div class="wrap"><span class="kicker">Made in Squamish</span><h2>Some things we've done along the way.</h2><div class="early-grid"><article><span>2017</span><h3>An open house with a talk.</h3><p>At the first open house, Peter invited Squamish in to work, look around, and hear futurist Nikolas Badminton speak. It was a workday that kept going into an evening together.</p></article><article><span>2017</span><h3>A pass for people on the move.</h3><p>Early members told Peter they travelled between Squamish, Whistler, and Vancouver. The historical Sea to Sky Common Pass grew out of those conversations. The old partner arrangement is not a current membership offer.</p></article><article><span>2018</span><h3>Politics, meet air hockey.</h3><p>For the local election, Peter announced an all candidates air hockey tournament at The Common. The plan was a friendly contest on the table, with proceeds going to Howe Sound Women’s Shelter.</p></article><article><span>2021</span><h3>A little April Fools mischief.</h3><p>The Common once announced two outdoor offices: one at Newport Beach and one on the Stawamus Chief. It was an April Fools joke, and a very Squamish one.</p></article></div><a class="inline-link" href="/community/">More about the community</a></div></section>
</Base>

<style>
  .founder-section{background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) 0}.founder-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center}.founder-copy h2,.workday-content h2,.name-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4.4rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.04;margin:.7rem 0 1.4rem}.founder-copy p,.name-copy p{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.3rem}.founder-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.18fr .82fr;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;min-height:560px}.founder-photos img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.peter-photo{grid-row:1/3;object-position:center 35%}.entrance-photo{object-position:center}.town-photo{object-position:center 32%}
  .workday-section{min-height:760px;position:relative;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:end;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden}.workday-collage{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .9fr 1.05fr;gap:.65rem;background:#153b2a}.workday-collage img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.workday-collage img:first-child{object-position:52% center}.workday-collage img:last-child{object-position:60% center}.workday-section:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(15,34,26,.89),rgba(15,34,26,.53) 55%,rgba(15,34,26,.16)),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,34,26,.5),transparent 55%)}.workday-content{width:100%;padding-block:7rem 5rem}.workday-content .kicker{color:#f4d2ba}.workday-content h2{max-width:670px}.workday-content p{font-size:1.12rem;max-width:560px;color:#f3f5ed}.workday-content .btn{margin-top:1rem;background:#fff;color:var(--forest)}
  .name-section{background:#ebe9df;padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem) 0}.name-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;align-items:center;gap:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem)}.name-photo{margin-left:max(-4vw,-90px)}.name-photo img{width:100%;height:560px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center}.name-copy{max-width:600px}.name-copy h2{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.name-copy .btn{margin-top:.7rem}
  .founder-photos{gap:0;position:relative;isolation:isolate}
  .founder-photos img{border:8px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 15px 28px #27382b30}
  .founder-photos .peter-photo{transform:rotate(-2deg);z-index:3}
  .founder-photos .entrance-photo{transform:rotate(3deg) translate(-12px,7px);z-index:2}
  .founder-photos .town-photo{transform:rotate(-3deg) translate(-15px,-9px);z-index:1}
  .name-photo{padding:12px 12px 26px;background:#fff;transform:rotate(-2deg);box-shadow:18px 18px 0 #d7c6b0,0 24px 35px #1c30292a}
  @media(max-width:850px){.founder-grid,.name-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.founder-photos{min-height:460px}.name-photo{margin-left:0}.name-photo img{height:360px}.workday-section{min-height:680px}.workday-collage{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.workday-collage img:last-child{display:none}.workday-section:after{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(15,34,26,.93),rgba(15,34,26,.3) 85%)}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.founder-photos{min-height:400px;gap:.4rem}.founder-copy h2,.workday-content h2,.name-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,9vw,3.3rem)}.workday-section{min-height:760px}.workday-collage{display:block}.workday-collage img{position:absolute;inset:0}.workday-collage img:not(:first-child){display:none}.workday-content{padding-block:5rem 3rem}}
</style>
<style>.early-stories h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:.8rem 0 2rem}.early-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:2rem 3rem;margin-bottom:2.3rem}.early-grid article{border-top:2px solid var(--forest);padding-top:1.2rem}.early-grid span{font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700;color:var(--forest)}.early-grid h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin:.4rem 0 .7rem}.early-grid p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:680px){.early-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
